+- Static-only disposition (`investigate` / `likely_noise` / `unknown`): ____________________
+- Review time in seconds: ____________________
+- Evidence reviewed and reasoning: __________________________________________________
+- Remaining unknowns: ______________________________________________________________
+
+Suggested review questions: identify the callback object owner and production registration/call path; verify the platform’s assignment and trust semantics for UID 3020 from an authoritative source; determine whether an untrusted process can invoke this callback; and establish the actual data and recipient behavior of `GetRemoteHapTokenInfo`.
+
+The existing API accepts this baseline at `POST /api/v1/agent/baseline-reviews` with `job_id`, `candidate_id`, `experiment_id`, `reviewer`, `disposition`, optional `elapsed_seconds`, and `notes`. Submit it through the isolated 18776 workbench only after a human has completed the fields above. Do not copy an AI/Fake Provider answer into the R0 record.
